 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 2.8,
   "end": 6.44,
   "text": "You tell the stranger behind the hatch about your journey into this world and"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.5,
   "end": 9.88,
   "text": "ask him whether he could give you something to eat and a place to spend the night."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.06,
   "end": 15.56,
   "text": "Surprisingly, he doesn't doubt your story in the slightest: \"Of course I could...\","
  },
  {
   "start": 15.58,
   "end": 19.96,
   "text": "the voice behind the door drawls, \"But only on one condition:"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.013,
   "end": 25.48,
   "text": "if I help you, you must promise to do me a small favour, too: there is a small,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.5,
   "end": 29.52,
   "text": "and of course not too dangerous, task that has to be done tomorrow."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.64,
   "end": 33.0,
   "text": "If you sign a short written declaration that you will do it for me,"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.04,
   "end": 37.32,
   "text": "I will give you a bed to sleep in, warm clothes and a warm supper in return.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 37.496,
   "end": 42.92,
   "text": "With these words, the man hands you a contract, strangely enough already written out,"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.96,
   "end": 45.48,
   "text": "and a small, sharp little knife through the hatch."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.027,
   "end": 50.2,
   "text": "When you ask what you need the knife for, the stranger answers indifferently:"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.289,
   "end": 53.889,
   "text": "\"I'm just careful - too many people have betrayed me already!"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.969,
   "end": 56.369,
   "text": "That's why you will sign our agreement with the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.436,
   "end": 59.009,
   "text": "blood that you will shed should you dare to break it...\""
  }
 ]
}
